        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Cut the potatoes into roughly even 2cm cubes so they cook at the same rate. Floury varieties such as Maris Piper break down at the edges slightly and help thicken the sauce, which is a good thing." }]
      },
